{"slug":"Jim's-RNG-RULER-OF-EVERYTHING-OP-Aura-Changer-19936","_id":"67078bc23f316809b1549b3b","title":"OP  Aura Changer","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c786d0","gameId":16819979927,"name":"Jim's RNG [CRAFTING]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":16819979927},"features":"Not that active of a game but thought that it was funny that you could equip any aura you wanted.\n\nEveryone can see the aura you have equipped but it doesn't get saved in your inventory.\n\nTo find aura names go to ReplicatedStorage then Auras on any explorer script.","tags":[],"script":"FOR EQUIPPING AURAS THAT DONT HAVE A SPACE IN THE NAME:\n\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = game:FindService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Auras.AuraName\n}\n\ngame:FindService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Remotes.AuraEquip:FireServer(unpack(args))\n\n\nFOR EQUPPING AURAS THAT HAVE A SPACE IN THE NAME:\n\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = game:FindService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Auras:FindFirstChild(\"AuraName\")\n}\n\ngame:FindService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Remotes.AuraEquip:FireServer(unpack(args))\n\n\nMOST DISRUPTIVE AURA IN THE GAME (EARRAPE AND MASSIVE SIZE):\n\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = game:FindService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Auras:FindFirstChild(\"Insanity : A M A L G A M A T I O N\")\n}\n\ngame:FindService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Remotes.AuraEquip:FireServer(unpack(args))\n","owner":{"_id":"66d98e6f818c5903e5c88ebd","username":"lololihatemen","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"66d98e6f818c5903e5c88ebd","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":17034,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-10-10T08:09:38.310Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":0,